# Event Naming

Name `event` members with an `On` prefix:

- `OnGemCollected`, not `GemCollected`
- `OnAllRequiredGemsCollected`, not `AllRequiredGemsCollected`
- `OnPlayerCaught`, not `PlayerCaught`

Handler methods may use the same name or a `Handle` prefix — avoid ambiguous names in the declaring class when needed.

```csharp
// BAD
public event Action<GameObject> GemCollected;
public event Action AllRequiredGemsCollected;

// GOOD
public event Action<GameObject> OnGemCollected;
public event Action OnAllRequiredGemsCollected;
```
